# Deterministic line endings: normalise all text files to LF in the repo and on
# checkout, regardless of a contributor's git core.autocrlf. Without this, a
# Windows checkout under autocrlf=true materialises CRLF working-tree files that
# trip the LF-enforcing formatters (dotnet format, oxfmt) locally even though the
# committed blobs are already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalise or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.epub binary
*.pdf binary
